{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03：加入想确认对方是不是也有同样感受的念头，把焦点稍微引向感情是否对等、是否得到回应。\",\n    \"S07：新增对方是否需要自己、是否能从自己身上获得安心的推断，让亲密的幸福带上了被需要、被依赖的意味。\",\n    \"S12：突出不顾对方是否同样在乎、只想把能给的都给出去，使主线偏向单方面付出和自我奉献。\",\n    \"S13：把失去亲密的痛楚进一步具体化为对方将来不再需要自己，容易将中心从亲密本身无法长久，转成害怕失去自身对对方的价值。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条线都有亲密带来的幸福，也都有明知无法保证长久却舍不得放手的痛楚，而且两者始终相互牵动。X 更直接围绕亲密本身及其不可留住展开；Y 则反复引入对方是否需要自己、是否同样在乎自己的问题，使主线部分转向对等回应与被需要的焦虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1d833e99-e283-4681-ae22-7d3d91712b0c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T081048425325Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:11:07.012311+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d749709f330a6e9d057a7d0ae42d0f2151af13618c5a49c44e39761b758d73b2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha